{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>As if</b> — the meaning is: if he escapes one evil he will not escape another, as when he flees, for <i>hovah</i> upon <i>hovah</i> shall come. And the one who escapes the lion — the bear shall meet him. And if he still escapes and enters the house and is confident that he has escaped — a serpent shall bite him."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:10.293195315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}